The '''Felstrider Retreat''' is a fortified mountain fortress nestled in the western [[Thalassian Highlands]]. It is inhabited by remnants of [[Kael'thas Sunstrider]]'s forces that did not accompany the [[Illidari]] to [[Northrend]], now led by Viceroy [[Eldin Sunstrider]] as they await word from their Prince.

